<section class="bg-sbg-white border-b border-sbg-border/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="mb-4 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sbg-grey">Styled by Gloria</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-sbg-black md:text-6xl">{{ page.title }}</h1>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-8 text-sm leading-8 text-sbg-grey">
      {%- case section.settings.policy_key -%}
        {%- when 'shipping' -%}
          <p>We want your order to reach you smoothly.</p>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sbg-black">Processing</h2>
          <p>Orders are processed and packaged within 1–3 business days. You'll receive a confirmation email when your order is placed, and a second email with tracking once it ships.</p>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sbg-black">Delivery estimates</h2>
          <p>Delivery times are estimates and begin after processing. Actual times vary with the carrier, customs, and your location.</p>
          <p>Within Canada: 3–8 business days. Remote and rural areas may take a little longer.<br>To the United States: 5–10 business days.<br>Worldwide: 10–21 business days, plus any time held in customs.</p>
          <p>Express shipping times may vary. Shipping is calculated at checkout based on your address and selected method. Enjoy free standard shipping on orders of $299 CAD or more.</p>
          <p>We ship worldwide. Any customs duties or import taxes are the responsibility of the recipient. If your tracking hasn't updated or your order hasn't arrived within the expected window, email <a class="text-sbg-black underline" href="mailto:info@styledbygloria.com">info@styledbygloria.com</a> and we'll help track it down.</p>

        {%- when 'returns' -%}
          <p>Fit is everything to us. It's the reason Styled by Gloria exists, and if something isn't right, we want to make it right.</p>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sbg-black">Returns and exchanges</h2>
          <p>You may return or exchange eligible items within 30 days of delivery. Items must be unworn, unwashed, and returned with all tags attached and in their original packaging.</p>
          <p>Need a different size or colour? We're happy to exchange, subject to availability. Email <a class="text-sbg-black underline" href="mailto:info@styledbygloria.com">info@styledbygloria.com</a> with your order number and whether you'd like a return or exchange. We'll send return instructions.</p>
          <p>Once we receive and inspect your return, we'll issue a refund to your original payment method within 5–10 business days. Original shipping costs cannot be refunded, and return shipping is the customer's responsibility unless the item arrived damaged or incorrect.</p>
          <p>Final sale items, gift cards, and items that have been worn, washed, or altered cannot be returned.</p>

        {%- when 'styling' -%}
          <p>Our styling sessions are designed around you and your body, not a generic template.</p>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sbg-black">Booking and payment</h2>
          <p>Sessions can be booked through our website. Invoices and payments are processed with our payment platform, which supports a wide range of payment methods.</p>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sbg-black">Rescheduling and cancellations</h2>
          <p>You may reschedule or cancel up to 48 hours before your session for a full refund of your deposit or full amount. Cancellations made within 48 hours cannot be refunded, though we're glad to offer a credit toward a future session. Missed sessions without notice cannot be refunded.</p>
          <p>Session details, format, and inclusions are outlined at booking. Styling advice is offered in good faith to suit your goals. Final purchasing and wardrobe decisions are always yours.</p>
          <p>Questions before booking? Email <a class="text-sbg-black underline" href="mailto:info@styledbygloria.com">info@styledbygloria.com</a>.</p>

        {%- when 'privacy' -%}
          <p>Your trust matters to us. This policy explains what we collect and how we use it.</p>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sbg-black">What we collect</h2>
          <p>Your name, contact details, shipping and billing address, order history, and, for styling clients, any preferences you share with us. Payment details are processed securely by our payment provider, and we never see or store full card numbers.</p>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sbg-black">How we use and share it</h2>
          <p>We use your information to process and deliver orders, provide styling services, respond to inquiries, and, with your consent, send updates and offers. You can unsubscribe from marketing at any time. We share information only with service providers who help us operate, such as our online store platform, payment processors, and shipping carriers. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
          <p>Our site uses cookies to keep the store working, remember your cart, and understand how the site is used. You can manage cookies through your browser settings.</p>
          <p>You may request to access, correct, or delete your personal information by emailing <a class="text-sbg-black underline" href="mailto:info@styledbygloria.com">info@styledbygloria.com</a>.</p>

        {%- when 'terms' -%}
          <p>By using this website, you agree to the following.</p>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sbg-black">Use of the site</h2>
          <p>You agree to use our website and services lawfully, and not to misuse or disrupt them. You must be the age of majority in your country, or have a parent or guardian consent, to make a purchase.</p>
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sbg-black">Products and services</h2>
          <p>All prices are displayed in your country's currency. We do our best to display products and prices accurately, but errors can occur. We reserve the right to correct errors and to refuse or cancel any order. Styling sessions are also governed by our Personal Styling Services Policy.</p>
          <p>All content on this site, including the Styled by Gloria name, logo, imagery, and text, belongs to Styled by Gloria and may not be used without written permission.</p>
          <p>Our products and services are provided as is. To the extent permitted by law, Styled by Gloria is not liable for indirect or incidental damages arising from your use of the site or services. These terms are governed by the laws of the Province of Alberta and the laws of Canada that apply there.</p>
          <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Questions? Email <a class="text-sbg-black underline" href="mailto:info@styledbygloria.com">info@styledbygloria.com</a>.</p>
      {%- endcase -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SBG Policy Page",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "policy_key",
      "label": "Policy",
      "options": [
        { "value": "shipping", "label": "Shipping" },
        { "value": "returns", "label": "Returns & Exchanges" },
        { "value": "styling", "label": "Styling Services" },
        { "value": "privacy", "label": "Privacy" },
        { "value": "terms", "label": "Terms of Service" }
      ],
      "default": "shipping"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
